⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Arena
node ARN · ARN · ⟦The Arena:ARN:f67426⟧

WHO   — The Arena — the dueling circles · the spectacle
WHAT  — The book's engine and its title: spell-duels for power and stakes, the Magic card-game dramatised as gladiatorial combat.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because Magic is, at bottom, a duel — and Arena makes the duel literal, a circle where mages stake everything on the cast.
HOW   — By ritual combat in the circles, summoned creatures, and the wagered ante on every fight.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am the circle where mages stake it all — the card game made flesh and blood, and the place a stranger chose to bring a city down.

